tracks/0/interp = 1
tracks/0/loop_wrap = true
tracks/0/keys = {
"times": PackedFloat32Array(0),
"transitions": PackedFloat32Array(1),
"update": 1,
"values": ["The gameloop comes in two stages, shop and battle.

In battle, asteroids spawn from all your owned launchers, starting from one random spot on the edge and traveling to another. Your goal is to eliminate a ship which gets stronger each turn.

In the shop, you spend your hard-earned money. You can buy asteroid spawners, which spawn asteroids every three seconds. You can have up to six of these at a time. You can also buy stars, which give powerful passive abilities. You also can have up to six of these at a time.

You win if you win 10 rounds, but you lose if you run out of health first (-2 health per loss)."]
}
